{"4256890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Dead", "steam_appid": 4256890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control The Horde</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is already dead. Cities crumble. Roads crack beneath endless footsteps. Humanity survives only in scattered pockets - scavenging ruins, rebuilding hope, clinging on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you are here to end that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/f6b20433702a8d3b3aa63edb4342f4ba.poster.avif?t=1788195178\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/f6b20433702a8d3b3aa63edb4342f4ba.webm?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/f6b20433702a8d3b3aa63edb4342f4ba.mp4?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>THE DEAD</strong>, you are  <strong>one of the undead</strong> and <strong>ALL</strong> of the undead- a single body in a vast, rotting sea that is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zombie is yours to become and control. When one body falls, you simply awaken in the next. The Horde never stops. The hunger never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt the last humans. Track their scavengers across the remains of the old world. Grow your numbers. Swarm their outposts. Tear down their fragile camps and erase the final traces of civilisation - one survivor at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/565e8af040ae0898cfff2d3447a9272e.poster.avif?t=1788195178\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/565e8af040ae0898cfff2d3447a9272e.webm?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/565e8af040ae0898cfff2d3447a9272e.mp4?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The few humans that remain are tough, desperate, organised. They will fight back. They will build, fortify, and adapt. But the dead do not tire. The dead do not fear. And as long as a single corpse remains standing…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…you will return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only <strong>finishing it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/9d050ad07cf681ec3125d56ce2b8222c.poster.avif?t=1788195178\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/9d050ad07cf681ec3125d56ce2b8222c.webm?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/9d050ad07cf681ec3125d56ce2b8222c.mp4?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person zombie gameplay</strong> in a post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command and control zombie hordes</strong> while directly playing as one of them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor bases, scavenger groups, and roaming human threats</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Days atmosphere</strong> - low light, tension, and constant danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical horde-based combat</strong> instead of mindless swarming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent consequences</strong> - poor decisions thin your numbers</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control The Horde</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is already dead. Cities crumble. Roads crack beneath endless footsteps. Humanity survives only in scattered pockets - scavenging ruins, rebuilding hope, clinging on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you are here to end that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/f6b20433702a8d3b3aa63edb4342f4ba.poster.avif?t=1788195178\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/f6b20433702a8d3b3aa63edb4342f4ba.webm?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/f6b20433702a8d3b3aa63edb4342f4ba.mp4?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>THE DEAD</strong>, you are  <strong>one of the undead</strong> and <strong>ALL</strong> of the undead- a single body in a vast, rotting sea that is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zombie is yours to become and control. When one body falls, you simply awaken in the next. The Horde never stops. The hunger never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt the last humans. Track their scavengers across the remains of the old world. Grow your numbers. Swarm their outposts. Tear down their fragile camps and erase the final traces of civilisation - one survivor at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/565e8af040ae0898cfff2d3447a9272e.poster.avif?t=1788195178\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/565e8af040ae0898cfff2d3447a9272e.webm?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/565e8af040ae0898cfff2d3447a9272e.mp4?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The few humans that remain are tough, desperate, organised. They will fight back. They will build, fortify, and adapt. But the dead do not tire. The dead do not fear. And as long as a single corpse remains standing…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…you will return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only <strong>finishing it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/9d050ad07cf681ec3125d56ce2b8222c.poster.avif?t=1788195178\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/9d050ad07cf681ec3125d56ce2b8222c.webm?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/extras/9d050ad07cf681ec3125d56ce2b8222c.mp4?t=1788195178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person zombie gameplay</strong> in a post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command and control zombie hordes</strong> while directly playing as one of them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor bases, scavenger groups, and roaming human threats</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Days atmosphere</strong> - low light, tension, and constant danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical horde-based combat</strong> instead of mindless swarming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent consequences</strong> - poor decisions thin your numbers</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Control the Horde. Hunt the last humans. Track their scavengers across the remains of the old world. Grow your numbers. Swarm their outposts. Tear down their fragile camps and erase the final traces of civilisation - one survivor at a time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/adee24f0baefc9a4b26ab42fccfbe74acd0e90ee/header.jpg?t=1788195178", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/dde9a873603a53180137256bf84581c64aa523d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788195178", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256890/dde9a873603a53180137256bf84581c64aa523d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788195178", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 • AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB • AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><